      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The West End currently functions as a dense, vibrant residential hub characterized by its diverse, working-class population and established local businesses. However, its existing infrastructure and heightened street congestion present tangible operational challenges that limit growth potential. Investing in revitalization will transform these current limitations into assets, positioning the West End as a forward-thinking, desirable district for both new enterprises and higher-end investment. This upgrade is key to enhancing the city's overall appeal and economic vitality.",
